n (3), set out the source and nature, but not the value, of the income, assets and liabilities referred to in the Member’s statement filed under section 20;(b) identify any contracts or subcontracts referred to in paragraph 21(1)(c) and describe their subject-matter and nature;(c) list the names of any affiliated corporations referred to in that statement; (d) include a copy of any statements of disclosure filed by the Member under subsections 14(3), 15(1) and 21(3); (e) list the positions and corporations, trade or professional associations and trade unions disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(e); and (f) list any trusts disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(b.1). Mel Arnold · Member of Parliament Declaration type Disclosure Summaries (Code) Disclosure date March 12, 2026 Regime Conflict of Interest Code for Members of the House of Commons Description Liabilities- Guarantor with spouse of a loan held by SASCU Credit Union for Complete Marine Detailing IncInvestment in Private Corporations- Significant interest in Complete Marine Detailing Inc, a boat and RV repair firmActivities- President of Complete Marine Detailing IncSpouse's/Common-Law Partner's investment in private corporations- Significant interest in Complete Marine Detailing Inc, a boat and RV repair firmSpouse's/Common-Law Partner's activities- Director of Complete Marine Detailing Inc Disclosed on March 12, 2026","url":"https://www.ethicscanada.ca/en/public-registry/Details?declarationId=81d347d5-b21c-f111-81a4-001dd8b72449"}],"other":[]},"lobbying":{"total":337,"first":"2015-11-17","last":"2026-10-15","byYear":{"2015":2,"2016":29,"2017":16,"2018":18,"2019":19,"2020":35,"2021":34,"2022":31,"2023":46,"2024":56,"2025":21,"2026":30},"topSubjects":[["Fisheries",73],["Environment",62],["Industry",47],["International Trade",41],["Agriculture",40],["Economic Development",39],["Health",32],["Transportation",31]],"topOrgs":[["BC Dairy Association",25],["Tourism Industry Association of Canada",10],["fisheries council of can